HB=f'<section class="ckcard" aria-labelledby="ckh"><div><h2 id="ckh">Do I need a licence or registration for my short let?</h2><p>Pick your nation and council for the key requirements, with source links. Free to <a href="embed.html">embed on your own site</a>.</p></div><a class="cta" href="checker.html">Open the licence checker</a></section><h2 class="sec">Rules by nation</h2><div class="ngrid">{pcards}</div><h2 class="sec">Latest changes</h2><ul class="chg">{pch}</ul><p><a href="changes.html">Full changes log &rarr;</a></p><section class="tools"><h2 class="sec">Free tools and guides</h2>{_tools}</section><section class="nl"><h2>Weekly "what changed" email</h2><p>One short, sourced email a week. Unsubscribe any time.</p>{FORM}</section>'
